<http://data.silknow.org/object/136b7478-99c7-36dc-b37d-7800f4c94b10>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven in silk and silver-gilt thread on a satin ground, in green, yellow, red, white, pale blue and pale brown. The design has five vertical stripes, separated by narrower ones, with the latter left plain, while the former are filled with repeating patterns. Of the patterened stripes, one set have seated human figures alternating with birds perched on flowering stems, while on the rest are symmetrical floral stems between pairs of birds."@en , "Brocaded, with human figures, birds and flowers in stripes; Persia; 1700-1729."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2e168fca-7e73-3121-9899-f10fafaf6e48> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/3cfcf56c-54df-385b-9453-20426d2f72b1> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Brocaded, with human figures, birds and flowers in stripes; Persia; 1700-1729."@en , "Woven in silk and silver-gilt thread on a satin ground, in green, yellow, red, white, pale blue and pale brown. The design has five vertical stripes, separated by narrower ones, with the latter left plain, while the former are filled with repeating patterns. Of the patterened stripes, one set have seated human figures alternating with birds perched on flowering stems, while on the rest are symmetrical floral stems between pairs of birds."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/136b7478-99c7-36dc-b37d-7800f4c94b10/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/136b7478-99c7-36dc-b37d-7800f4c94b10/dimension/1> ;
